ticles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE5wcmgwZ2w4M2t3eXJZU05VVHRnaE5KTGdKcWUwdUU3cmdIUGRrcHdVZXFlX0R4UmNCYXpJTC1aQzFiZnZFRkZkNmRPQW1uNEZESlFaU0lHVzR4STgyaFFlZmtENWVscHlyd2w0dFpfelRYdjhNQkE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"克羅格製定 2029 年成長計畫：銷售額成長 3%，每股盈餘年增 7%-11%"},{"title":"Kroger to Cut About 3,000 Corporate Jobs Over Three Years, Accelerating AI Adoption","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBwblhiN0dqX1JwLTlWMXZEOHA1cWJEY29aMjFkMEQ0WmZWSm5wNXh4OE52MzB5clBid080Wm1obFBDMUFpSDhKTVlrcEtWQ29wRWxVTHI3dDBEdGRqVmVCRWc3SEtWTGZwTkJ4TjdNYWpEeGI4aVE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"Kroger 將在三年內裁員約 3,000 名企業，加速人工智慧的採用"},{"title":"Kroger to Eliminate 3,000 Corporate Jobs in Largest Restructuring in Its 143-Year History","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE80Zng4QlhyclZIOERzTGlXTFN0M2dmTnJjcFJfdi1yejJ6TGNnMlA4TmNRUjlic01nQWV1dm1JbzJrYk91R2ZWQ0FiV0E5SUVxbTN3cUMyU2dIenM0VzZINW5uS0NXRzZsd085MXFqaWRYdTRtTEE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-12","zh":"克羅格將裁減 3,000 個企業職位，這是其 143 年歷史上最大規模的重組"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"裁員/重組","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-31","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/56873/000110465926037723/kr-20260131x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Kroger Co. (the \"Company\" or \"Kroger\") was founded in 1883 and incorporated in 1902. Our Company is built on the foundation of our retail grocery business, which includes the added convenience of our retail pharmacies and fuel centers. Our strategy is focused on growing households and increasing customer loyalty by delivering great value and convenience, and investing in Fresh, Our Brands, Personalization and eCommerce.","zh":"克羅格公司（以下簡稱「本公司」或「克羅格」）成立於 1883 年，並於 1902 年註冊成立。我們公司建立在零售雜貨業務的基礎上，其中包括零售藥局和加油中心的額外便利。我們的策略重點是透過提供巨大的價值和便利性以及投資於生鮮、我們的品牌、個人化和電子商務來增加家庭數量並提高客戶忠誠度。"},{"en":"We utilize the data and traffic generated by our retail business to create personalized experiences and value for our customers. This data and traffic also enable our fast-growing, high operating margin alternative profit business, including third-party media revenue. In turn, the value generated from these businesses enables us to reinvest back into our retail business.","zh":"我們利用零售業務產生的數據和流量為客戶創造個人化體驗和價值。這些數據和流量也使我們能夠實現快速成長、高營業利潤的替代利潤業務，包括第三方媒體收入。反過來，這些業務產生的價值使我們能夠重新投資於我們的零售業務。"},{"en":"Our revenues are predominately earned and cash is generated as consumer products are sold to customers in our stores and fuel centers and via our online platforms. We earn income predominately by selling products at price levels that produce revenues in excess of the costs we incur to make these products available to our customers. Such costs include procurement and distribution costs, facility occupancy and operational costs, and overhead expenses. Our fiscal year ends on the Saturday closest to January 31. All references to 2025, 2024 and 2023 are to the fiscal years ended January 31, 2026, February 1, 2025 and February 3, 2024, respectively, unless specifically indicated otherwise.","zh":"我們的收入主要是透過在我們的商店和加油中心以及透過我們的線上平台向客戶銷售消費品來賺取和產生現金的。我們主要透過以價格水平銷售產品來賺取收入，這些產品產生的收入超過了我們向客戶提供這些產品所產生的成本。這些成本包括採購和分銷成本、設施佔用和營運成本以及管理費用。我們的財政年度於最接近 1 月 31 日的星期六結束。除非另有明確說明，否則所有提及的 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年均分別指截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日、2025 年 2 月 1 日和 2024 年 2 月 3 日的財政年度。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As of January 31, 2026, Kroger operates supermarkets under a variety of local banner names in 35 states and the District of Columbia. As of January 31, 2026, Kroger operated, either directly or through its subsidiaries, 2,697 supermarkets, of which 2,250 had pharmacies and 1,731 had fuel centers. Approximately 51% of our supermarkets were operated in Company-owned facilities, including some Company-owned buildings on leased land. Our stores operate under a variety of banners that have strong local ties and brand recognition. We connect with customers through our growing network of in-store and digital shopping options, delivering a consistent full, fresh and friendly customer experience. Fuel sales are an important part of our revenue, net earnings and loyalty offering. Our fuel strategy is to include a fuel center at each of our supermarket locations when it is feasible and it is expect","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，克羅格在 35 個州和哥倫比亞特區以各種當地品牌經營超市。截至2026年1月31日，克羅格直接或透過其子公司經營2,697家超市，其中2,250家設有藥房，1,731家設有加油中心。我們約 51% 的超市在公司自有設施中運營，其中包括位於租賃土地上的一些公司自有建築物。我們的商店以各種品牌經營，並具有牢固的當地聯繫和品牌知名度。我們透過不斷發展的店內和數位購物選項網路與客戶建立聯繫，提供一致的完整、新鮮和友好的客戶體驗。燃料銷售是我們收入、淨利潤和忠誠度服務的重要組成部分。我們的燃料策略是在可行且預期的情況下在我們的每個超市地點都設立一個燃料中心"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Non Perishable","val":77569000000,"zh":"不易腐爛"},{"name":"Perishable","val":37189000000,"zh":"易腐爛"},{"name":"Pharmacy","val":18171000000,"zh":"藥局"},{"name":"Supermarket Fuel","val":13584000000,"zh":"超商燃料"},{"name":"Other Product","val":1129000000,"zh":"其他產品"}],"total":147642000000}},"peers":["KHC","TGT","CVS","GIS","LOW"]}}